 Cleanup
⍝ Removes the global variable `∆Automation` as well as the automation variables used by versions
⍝ prior to 2.0.0.\\
⍝ Calling this is safer than deleting `∆Automation` yourself, because a future version of `CommTools`
⍝ might have more to clean up.
 ⎕EX¨'Select_Choices' 'YesOrNo_Answers' 'NoPause' 'AskForNumber_Answers' 'AskForText_Answers' '∆LogAutoResponses' ⍝ Old stuff
 ⎕EX'∆Automation'
